{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13211580","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13211580","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"narration:0:1321158001:0":{"text":"Quietly, you toss the blessing elixir upward, enveloping Natasha and Alphus with a sacred and warm aura...","source_cn":"你悄悄扔出祝福药水，一股神圣而温暖的气息随之包裹住了娜...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x01E63EB4828C93E2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1321158002:1":{"text":"Hmm?","source_cn":"咦……？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7D4147835917B2AD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1321158003:1":{"text":"What's wrong, Natasha?","source_cn":"怎么了，娜塔莎？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF4BE55EE9339B34F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1321158004:1":{"text":"Alphus, can you feel a warm sensation around us? The feeling is like being baptized by the acolytes, but even purer and stronger!","source_cn":"阿尔希普，你有没有感受到一种很温暖的感觉？就像是……像...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2A07AA1A56514E37","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1321158005:1":{"text":"I can feel it too... It's very sacred.","source_cn":"确实有这种感觉……而且很神圣。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEEBBAC3EC92A8978","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1321158006:1":{"text":"Sacred?!\nThis is it! This is Dura's blessing!","source_cn":"神圣……？！\\n——我知道了！这是艾雅女神的祝福！！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x42152E041D9A400E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1321158007:1":{"text":"So, the most beautiful scenery doesn't refer to a specific place, but rather wherever you are with your loved one...","source_cn":"原来是这样……传说中的最美风景，并不是哪一个确切的地方...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF325A0399D4445B8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1321158008:1":{"text":"Alphus, pray with me to Dura now!","source_cn":"快！阿尔希普，快和我一起，向女神祈祷！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAF01A569E2F88408","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1321158009:1":{"text":"I'll follow your lead, my dear.","source_cn":"都听你的，亲爱的娜塔莎。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x420D6EDE58768D0E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:黑屏字幕":{"text":"Subtitles","source":"黑屏字幕","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:娜塔莎":{"text":"Natasha","source":"娜塔莎","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:阿